\n\nReason:\nI choose to **pass** because: (1) As the landlord in a 2v1 situation, I benefit from opponents competing against each other and depleting their cards; (2) Wasting premium control cards (K or jokers) on beating a mere J is inefficient; (3) My jokers and K should be reserved for crucial moments when I need to guarantee control or make my final push; (4) With 11 cards remaining, I\'m not in immediate danger and can afford to be patient.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
